#: ../../source/tutorials/full-oneelectron-embedding.md:1
msgid "Full-One-Electron Fixed-MO Embedding"
msgstr "固定分子轨道完整单电子嵌入"

#: ../../source/tutorials/full-oneelectron-embedding.md:3
msgid ""
"This tutorial runs a small H2/STO-3G active-space resource estimate in vacuum and near one TIP3P "
"water shell. It compares resource rows for `embedding_mode=\"diagonal\"` and "
"`embedding_mode=\"full_oneelectron\"`."
msgstr ""
"本教程在真空和一个 TIP3P 水壳层附近，对小规模 H2/STO-3G 活性空间进行资源估计，比较 `embedding_mode=\"diagonal\"` 和 "
"`embedding_mode=\"full_oneelectron\"` 的资源结果行。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/full-oneelectron-embedding.md:7
msgid "Run The Script"
msgstr "运行脚本"

#: ../../source/tutorials/full-oneelectron-embedding.md:13
msgid ""
"The script prints Hamiltonian `lambda`, Toffoli count, logical qubits, and `delta_h_offdiag_fro` "
"for:"
msgstr "脚本为以下各行打印哈密顿量 `lambda`、Toffoli 门数、逻辑量子比特数及 `delta_h_offdiag_fro`："

#: ../../source/tutorials/full-oneelectron-embedding.md
msgid "Row"
msgstr "结果行"

#: ../../source/tutorials/full-oneelectron-embedding.md
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../source/tutorials/full-oneelectron-embedding.md
msgid "`vacuum`"
msgstr "`vacuum`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/full-oneelectron-embedding.md
msgid "H2 without MM point charges"
msgstr "没有 MM 点电荷的 H2"

#: ../../source/tutorials/full-oneelectron-embedding.md
msgid "`diagonal`"
msgstr "`diagonal`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/full-oneelectron-embedding.md
msgid "Fixed-MO point-charge perturbation with only active-space `Delta h_pp`"
msgstr "固定分子轨道点电荷扰动，仅包含活性空间 `Delta h_pp`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/full-oneelectron-embedding.md
msgid "`full_oneelectron`"
msgstr "`full_oneelectron`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/full-oneelectron-embedding.md
msgid "Fixed-MO point-charge perturbation with full active-space `Delta h_pq`"
msgstr "固定分子轨道点电荷扰动，包含完整活性空间 `Delta h_pq`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/full-oneelectron-embedding.md:22
msgid "Minimal API Pattern"
msgstr "最小 API 用法"

#: ../../source/tutorials/full-oneelectron-embedding.md:66
msgid "Interpretation Boundaries"
msgstr "解释边界"

#: ../../source/tutorials/full-oneelectron-embedding.md:68
msgid ""
"`full_oneelectron` means the resource row includes the full fixed-MO active-space one-electron "
"perturbation. It does not mean relaxed orbital optimization, a polarizable MM force field, or a "
"relaxed solvation energy."
msgstr "`full_oneelectron` 表示资源结果行包含完整的固定分子轨道活性空间单电子扰动。它不表示弛豫轨道优化、可极化 MM 力场或弛豫后的溶剂化能。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/full-oneelectron-embedding.md:72
msgid ""
"The current runtime coefficient workflow updates only diagonal terms. Full-one-electron embedding"
" is available for resource estimates and fixed Hamiltonian/operator paths because off-diagonal "
"one-electron terms can change the compiled operator support."
msgstr "当前运行时系数工作流仅更新对角项。完整单电子嵌入可用于资源估计及固定哈密顿量 / 算符路径，因为非对角单电子项可能改变编译的算符支撑。"
